      "message": "Since this is not called on the handler thread, it may change between the check and the preference change, which would be incorrect (test permissions shouldn\u0027t allow clearing a non-test preference).\n\nThat\u0027s an edge case and probably low impact, but for correctness you could send a boolean to EVENT_SET_OEM_NETWORK_PREFERENCE saying it\u0027s a \"clear test\" request, or have a different EVENT_SET_TEST_OEM_NETWORK_PREFERENCE, and recheck mOemNetworkPreferences in the event instead.\n\nThis doesn\u0027t need to block this change I think.",
      "range": {
